Hi,
shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> has been a notoriously difficult problem, and I'm not aware of any solution (except to develop a fully integrated binary build system that can build the INLA binaries as part of the R package build process, without manual intervention; this does not currently exist).
I know some people who said they gave up on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> for INLA and used Posit Connect instead (but I don't know anything about how that works and if it can be used in the same way).
Finn

